{"id":"651794","name":"鸡蛋时蔬拌粉皮","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/651794/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"干粉皮","amount":"1张"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"半根"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"些许"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"些许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取粉皮，洗去浮尘。","img":"images/651794/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"温水浸泡。","img":"images/651794/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"旱黄瓜切粗丝。","img":"images/651794/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"胡萝卜焯水。","img":"images/651794/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"开锅捞出。","img":"images/651794/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"跟黄瓜放一起。","img":"images/651794/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸡蛋磕碗里搅散。","img":"images/651794/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/651794/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"油热倒入蛋液晃匀。","img":"images/651794/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎熟取出来。","img":"images/651794/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切宽条。","img":"images/651794/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"泡软的粉皮取出来。","img":"images/651794/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"切宽条。","img":"images/651794/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"锅烧开水。","img":"images/651794/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"取热水把粉皮烫变色。","img":"images/651794/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"捞出沥干水分。","img":"images/651794/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"蔬菜放一起所有食材放一起。","img":"images/651794/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"大蒜处理干净放食盐。","img":"images/651794/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/651794/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"捣成泥。","img":"images/651794/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"放陈醋和生抽。","img":"images/651794/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"放麻酱和香油。","img":"images/651794/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"放凉白开，搅拌均匀，到食材里。","img":"images/651794/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/651794/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/651794/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}